-- block_comment_test.runa: Test multiline block comments

----
This is a block comment.
It can span multiple lines.
Anything goes here: symbols, --dashes--, "strings", { braces }
----

> greet() -> String { "hello from Futuruna" }

----
This entire section is commented out.
> dead_code() -> Int { 42 }
Even invalid syntax: }{][>><< doesn't matter
----

-- regular line comment still works
@ print(greet())

---- inline block comment ----
@ print("block comments work!")
